00:49:11,275 --> 00:49:15,504
University, and received a bachelor's degree in environmental resource management

604
00:49:15,594 --> 00:49:20,904
and horticulture from the Pennsylvania State University. Oh, I almost got it right.

605
00:49:22,014 --> 00:49:27,744
In an era where we have tools such as large language models and agentic

606
